            "target_entity_type": "SimulationType",
            "paragraph": "Analogous to other studies on decadal prediction skill, we quantify the benefit that can be gained by initialising the model from the actual states of ocean and atmosphere, by comparing hindcasts against the results of climate projec- tions \u2013 so called uninitialised simulations - produced with basically the same model configuration. These are identical to the CMIP5-historical-experiments and contain potential prediction skill resulting solely from the long-term responses to external forcings.",
