            "relation": "OBSERVED_IN_REGION",
            "target_entity_instance": "North Atlantic",
            "target_entity_type": "No_Country_Region",
            "paragraph": "On the other hand, M\u00fcller et al. (2012) point out that MPI-ESM-LR exhibits a zonal extension of the North Atlantic current, leading to enormous temperature biases in this region (elaborately shown by Jungclaus et al., 2013), which M\u00fcller et al. (2012) expect to have a negative influ- ence on the simulated atmosphere.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
            "evidence_validated": true,
            "valid": true,
            "eval": true
        },
        {
            "source_entity_instance": "Kuroshio Extension",
