            "target_entity_instance": "North Pacific",
            "target_entity_type": "No_Country_Region",
            "paragraph": "Regarding the North Pacific, baseline1 performs worse than baseline0 in predicting SST (and related gradients) along the Kuroshio Extension for 2\u20135 yr lead time (not shown here but visible in Fig. 2b of Pohlmann et al., 2013), which might offer an explanation for the lack of skill regarding the predictions of the North Pacific storm track.",
